{"id":"n64690-1-7","stage":4,"title":"누전 · 漏电","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64690-1-7-1","ko":"지수야, 너희 옆집에서 불이 났다며?","zh":"智秀，听说你们隔壁着火了对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옆집에서","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불이","meaning":"火灾","explanation":"불：火灾；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"3","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났다며?","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代包括听者在内的多数人，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火灾","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"房子或东西被烧的灾祸或灾难。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a164dee7ab2faa06a0f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64690-1-7-2","ko":"응. 경찰이 그러는데 화재 원인은 전기 누전이래.","zh":"对。警察说是电路漏电导致的火灾。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경찰이","meaning":"警方，警察当局","explanation":"경찰：警方，警察当局；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경찰","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25949","senseId":"1","lemma":"경찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그러는데","meaning":"那么说","explanation":"그러다：那么说；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"2","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화재","meaning":"火灾","explanation":"화재：火灾","readings":[{"term":"화재","audio":"/audio/def28aae29facad94061.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87599","senseId":"1","lemma":"화재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"원인은","meaning":"原因，理由，缘由","explanation":"원인：原因，理由，缘由；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"원인","audio":"/audio/b84254868f623d278671.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70268","senseId":"1","lemma":"원인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전기","meaning":"电，电气","explanation":"전기：电，电气","readings":[{"term":"전기","audio":"/audio/8cd58eab1de8b2f5285f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70829","senseId":"1","lemma":"전기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누전이래.","meaning":"漏电，跑电","explanation":"누전：漏电，跑电；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"누전","audio":"/audio/83fd172972ee88c9c902.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64690","senseId":"1","lemma":"누전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。